  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十二关（前）\n時間未知 \\ 天氣未知 \\ 能見度 低\n切爾諾伯格 行動組E0所在地\nDr.{@nickname}營救行動 最終撤退階段"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "可惡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "明明已經在出口了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "這麼輕鬆就想離開切爾諾伯格......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "你們的白日夢，總該有人來戳醒吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "通訊設備已經恢復，我聯繫上了接應的行動預備組，他們正準備與會合！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "可是，這個傢伙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "小心她手中的爆破物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "但是，我還是聯繫不上偵查小組！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——你究竟是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "你不認識我很正常——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "不過，我認識你身邊那個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "整合運動......還要，繼續戰鬥嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "唉唉，別這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "我和那個塔露拉龍女可合不來。畢竟我並不是專職守門的人啊。做完了自己的工作趕過來也是很累的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "為了搞好關係，我們互換姓名吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "你可以叫我——W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "為了見你身邊那個人，我在這裡可是等了好久呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Dr.{@Nickname}......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "我有些問題想要問問{@Nickname}，能不能請各位把他......直接送給我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "你在浪費你自己的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "——別急嘛。我也有些你們會感興趣的情報哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "其實，我們剛剛遇到了不少身手很俐落的傢伙......和你們的穿著打扮差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "雖然做過偽裝，但也就是騙騙烏薩斯人的程度，這點小把戲，可是難不倒我的~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "偵察小隊的各位嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "太好了......他們平安無——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "小兔子，你就是他們的組織者吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "我很想知道，你究竟有什麼魔力......能讓他們都心甘情願，毫無價值地為你送命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "什麼......你想說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "沒錯，他們——沒有一個人能跟著你回去哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "你呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "你真的......配得上別人的犧牲嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "別管她，出口就在前方！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "阿米婭......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你的行為，有什麼意義嗎，W？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "還沒輪到你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "阿米婭......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "————你。生氣了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......你不該說這種話。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "好啊，好啊......就該這樣嘛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "來吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "整合運動的W，你不該說這種話！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "每個人的生命，都有價值......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "這不是你能玷污的事！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "博士！！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "羅德島，準備戰鬥！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "哼哼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
